    "Scan of the 1983 edition of the Old Panola, Texas, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1975; field checked in 1977; last revised in 1983; printed in 1983.",
    "Release: Provisional. Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 23 x 26.9 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
